Cousins Jacinta Rose and Mona Lisa Smith had been inseparable since childhood. The two girls were just one year apart in age and grew up close to one another in the small town of Burke, located in central northern New South Wales. Jacinta, who was the younger of the two, was better known by her nickname of Cindy. She was born on October 23, 1972 and was the youngest of seven children, with four brothers and two sisters. She lived with her mother Iona Dawn Smith and her siblings in a house on the east side of town.
表亲杰辛塔·罗斯和莫娜·丽莎·史密斯（Jacinta Rose and Mona Lisa Smith）自童年起就形影不离。两个女孩年龄仅相差一岁，在新南威尔士州中北部的小镇伯克（Burke）附近长大。杰辛塔是两人中较小的一个，人们更熟悉她的昵称辛迪。她出生于1972年10月23日，是七个孩子中最小的一个，有四个哥哥和两个姐姐。她与母亲艾奥娜·道恩·史密斯（Iona Dawn Smith）以及兄弟姐妹们住在镇东边的一所房子里。

